    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew of tiny aliens has crash-landed on Earth \u2014 and they need your help! In this <strong>classic match-3 puzzle game</strong> with a charming <strong>retro pixel art style</strong>, guide the aliens as they <strong>explore our world</strong> and search for a way home. Match adorable pixel aliens to unlock new locations, collect strange Earth items, and slowly piece together the coordinates to return to their galaxy. With its <strong>relaxing gameplay</strong>, it\u2019s a heartwarming, casual adventure across our planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Classic and satisfying match-3 mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Nostalgic retro pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Help the aliens discover Earth\u2019s wonders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Accessible puzzles with increasing challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing sound effects and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Uncover clues and build a path back to the stars</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the lost aliens learn, explore, and find their way home \u2014 one match at a time!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew of tiny aliens has crash-landed on Earth \u2014 and they need your help! In this <strong>classic match-3 puzzle game</strong> with a charming <strong>retro pixel art style</strong>, guide the aliens as they <strong>explore our world</strong> and search for a way home. Match adorable pixel aliens to unlock new locations, collect strange Earth items, and slowly piece together the coordinates to return to their galaxy. With its <strong>relaxing gameplay</strong>, it\u2019s a heartwarming, casual adventure across our planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Classic and satisfying match-3 mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Nostalgic retro pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Help the aliens discover Earth\u2019s wonders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Accessible puzzles with increasing challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing sound effects and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Uncover clues and build a path back to the stars</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the lost aliens learn, explore, and find their way home \u2014 one match at a time!</p>",
